		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23230#p23230"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>il faut supprimer toutes les lignes du pg_hba.conf et y mettre celle-ci à la place :<br />local&#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;::1/128&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160;192.168.1.1/24&#160; md5</p><p>+relance instance.</p>]]></content>
