		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>avez vous modifié votre pg_hba.conf comme ceci (+relance de l&#039;instance) :<br />local&#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;::1/128&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;md5<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160;192.168.1.1/24&#160; md5</p>]]></content>
